  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Messi's seventh Ballon d'Or. Was it deserved? Let's look at the case against.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "title",
        "heading": "LIONEL MESSI",
        "sub": "Ballon d'Or · 2021",
        "pill": "DESERVED?",
        "person": "messi"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "At Barcelona, thirty league goals and the Pichichi. But no league title, just the Copa del Rey.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stats",
        "title": "Barcelona 2020/21",
        "items": [
          {
            "n": "30",
            "l": "La Liga goals"
          },
          {
            "n": "1",
            "l": "Copa del Rey"
          },
          {
            "n": "0",
            "l": "league titles"
          }
        ],
        "person": "messi"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Then the Copa América. Game one, a free kick against Chile.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "score",
        "home": "arg",
        "away": "chi",
        "hs": 1,
        "as": 1,
        "date": "14 June 2021",
        "comp": "Copa América, group",
        "note": "Messi free kick"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Two against Bolivia, one a penalty.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "score",
        "home": "arg",
        "away": "bol",
        "hs": 4,
        "as": 1,
        "date": "28 June 2021",
        "comp": "Copa América, group",
        "note": "Messi x2"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Quarter-final, Ecuador. Two assists and another free kick.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "score",
        "home": "arg",
        "away": "ecu",
        "hs": 3,
        "as": 0,
        "date": "3 July 2021",
        "comp": "Copa América, quarter-final",
        "note": "Messi free kick + 2 assists"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Four goals, five assists, and finally a trophy with Argentina.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "trophies",
        "items": [
          {
            "kind": "cup",
            "label": "Copa América 2021"
          }
        ],
        "person": "messi"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Then PSG. His first league goal didn't come until the twentieth of November.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "text",
        "heading": "MESSI AT PSG, AUTUMN 2021",
        "body": "Three Champions League goals, against Manchester City and RB Leipzig. First Ligue 1 goal: 20 November, against Nantes."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Now the rivals. Robert Lewandowski. Forty-one Bundesliga goals, breaking Gerd Müller's record.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "versus",
        "title": "Bundesliga goals in a season",
        "left": {
          "person": "lewa",
          "label": "Lewandowski 2020/21",
          "value": "41"
        },
        "right": {
          "name": "Gerd Müller",
          "label": "Müller 1971/72",
          "value": "40"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And Jorginho. Champions League with Chelsea. Euros with Italy. UEFA's player of the year.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "trophies",
        "items": [
          {
            "kind": "bigears",
            "label": "Champions League"
          },
          {
            "kind": "euro",
            "label": "Euro 2020"
          }
        ],
        "person": "jorginho"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The result? Messi six hundred and thirteen. Lewandowski five hundred and eighty. Jorginho four hundred and sixty.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "podium",
        "year": "2021",
        "title": "Ballon d'Or",
        "places": [
          {
            "person": "messi",
            "club": "psg"
          },
          {
            "person": "lewa",
            "club": "bay"
          },
          {
            "person": "jorginho",
            "club": "che"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The case for Messi? He finally won with his country, and dragged Argentina there.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "person",
        "person": "messi",
        "label": "Copa América champion",
        "mood": "happy"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The case against? Forty-one goals. Or two of the biggest trophies in the game.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "whatif",
        "title": "Who should have won?",
        "real": {
          "label": "Real world",
          "value": "Messi, 613"
        },
        "alt": {
          "label": "The case against",
          "value": "Lewandowski or Jorginho"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Deserved, or robbed? You decide.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stamp",
        "text": "YOU DECIDE",
        "person": "messi",
        "color": "yellow"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Follow for more.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "cta"
      }
    }
  ]
